cksmann-the-man-who-wants-to-be-french-president" /><summary type="html">Raphaël Glucksmann has won the primary to represent the French centre-left in the upcoming presidential election, securing 66% of the vote.</summary><category term="Spotlight" /></entry><entry><title>🔴 Raphaël Glucksmann wins French left-wing primary with 66% of vote</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:5cff07d7e7e7025cfe809f6e9a77694a92c87177b1fa861a1178be36671d8a60</id><updated>2026-10-11T20:24:00Z</updated><published>2026-10-11T17:45:32Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="https://www.france24.com/en/france/20261011-rapha%C3%ABl-glucksmann-wins-french-primary-with-66-of-vote" /></entry><entry><title>Raphaël Glucksmann wins French left-wing primary with 66% of vote</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:7f53473c50c0e7760ebc7cfaff7f79c77813de9e41d1e37d1a7c8bcf32152f04</id><updated>2026-10-11T20:24:00Z</updated><published>2026-10-11T17:41:49Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="https://www.france24.com/en/france/20261011-rapha%C3%ABl-glucksmann-wins-french-primary-with-66-of-vote" /><summary type="html">Raphaël Glucksmann will be the centre-left candidate for France's 2027 presidential election following a crushing victory on Sunday, with 66.13% of the vote, positioning himself as the left's main alternative to hard-left leader Jean-Luc Mélenchon.</summary><category term="France" /></entry><entry><title>Ukraine: Coerced into a Corner?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:44eac72f72c3b3391770756ea682428d6b28c91081f291870c7dcde7de839bdf</id><updated>2026-10-11T20:24:00Z</updated><published>2026-10-11T17:36:49Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="https://www.france24.com/en/tv-shows/spotlight/20261011-ukraine-coerced-into-a-corner" /><summary type="html">It's reported that Ukraine is right now facing intense diplomatic pressure and coercion from the Trump administration to end the war quickly.</summary><category term="Spotlight" /></entry><entry><title>🔴 Live: Houthi rebels claim latest attacks on Riyadh airport, fol