nce-can-the-left-unite-behind-a-single-candidate" /><summary type="html">Five candidates are vying to lead France's social-democratic left in the 2027 presidential election, with a cyberattack disrupting the primary vote. Can the left unite behind one candidate? We discuss this with our guest Joseph Downing, Senior Lecturer in Politics and International Relations at Aston University.</summary></entry><entry><title>🔴 Trump says Russia and Ukraine agree to 'energy ceasefire'</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:e2378051d9c7aa2da0a6abe022f91ffc1b4540c9d98ed83de42de9d992346b0e</id><updated>2026-10-11T20:24:00Z</updated><published>2026-10-11T14:41:09Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/americas/20261011-trump-says-russia-and-ukraine-agree-energy-ceasefire--acf7a15a4061.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/americas/20261011-trump-says-russia-and-ukraine-agree-energy-ceasefire" /></entry><entry><title>India's 'cockroach' leaders vow to keep up election protests</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:6e7fabfc60a97768b94e6d6e3b3405c4903c10eafee83a50d5235f78b9f8ba21</id><updated>2026-10-11T20:24:00Z</updated><published>2026-10-11T14:40:27Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/video/20261011-india-s-cockroach-leaders-vow-to-keep-up-election-protests--4609159552e3.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261011-india-s-cockroach-leaders-vow-to-keep-up-election-protests" /><summary type="html">Leaders of India's online "cockroach" movement pledged on Sunday to continue their campaign against the election commissioner, hours after they were released from detention as authorities sought to thwart a major demonstration. Our correspondent Navodita Kumari tells us more.</summary></entry><entry><title>Strike on Riyadh: What options for the Saudi-led coalition?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:e412590fd19daa44771e66141f4f02c6636ef0adbf45d268ac29fc8cec737df6