io Lula da Silva's campaign accusing the tech platform of blocking content on the company's platforms. Brazil's Superior Electoral Court on Saturday gave the social media giant 48 hours to clarify whether it reduced the reach of posts by Lula's campaign ahead of the tight October 25 run-off against rightwing candidate Flavio Bolsonaro.</summary><category term="Americas" /></entry><entry><title>🔴Pope Leo says will undergo surgery for early-stage lung nodule</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:9c13aaa389d6f0fbfda33a2713addfa93e233e17348d22098033d24fd8973cf9</id><updated>2026-10-11T20:24:00Z</updated><published>2026-10-11T10:35:34Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/europe/20261011-pope-leo-says-will-undergo-surgery-for-early-stage-lung-nodule--110af765b1d1.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/europe/20261011-pope-leo-says-will-undergo-surgery-for-early-stage-lung-nodule" /></entry><entry><title>Pope Leo says will undergo surgery for early-stage lung nodule</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:d8461f0d02fe58c4aa528ca66133355e3dd301fe7e790a2d5e3a1069c73fbb2a</id><updated>2026-10-11T20:24:00Z</updated><published>2026-10-11T10:34:22Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/europe/20261011-pope-leo-says-will-undergo-surgery-for-early-stage-lung-nodule--110af765b1d1.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/europe/20261011-pope-leo-says-will-undergo-surgery-for-early-stage-lung-nodule" /><summary type="html">Pope Leo XIV said Sunday he would undergo surgery in the coming days for a lung nodule detected at an early stage.</summary><category term="Europe" /></entry><entry><title>Trump says Ukraine needs new president who will agree to end war</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:1e399bada587bc8cfc674ea6a5d5b82698829aa49b6bdc92ea22a0f4b9510d9b</id><updated>2026-10-11T20:24:00Z</updated><published>2026-10-11T10:28:56Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../..